# The storage cap (phase 3): with the saved articles at the cap (10 MB here, 10.2 MB of it used), saving one more is refused
# with a plain message; then Download images = Off and a larger cap: an article never opened shows "Images are off" in its
# placeholders (pictures already in the image cache still show) and is saved without its pictures, the notice says so.
seed pin us-ars-technica
seed refresh
seed refresh_on_open off
seed hint seen
seed cap 10
seed filler 10200
wait 900
key enter
wait 400
key enter
wait 800
key down
key enter
wait 1500
expect state page reader
expect state images RR
key ctrl-o
wait 400
tap "Save for offline"
wait 1500
expect state popup info
expect text "^Saved articles use 10 of 10 MB. Delete some or raise the limit in Settings."
expect state is_saved 0
shot 01-refused
check refused
key enter
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
key end
key enter
wait 500
expect state page settings
key down
key down
wait 200
expect state settings_sel 3
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Off"
key down
key down
wait 200
expect state settings_sel 7
key enter
wait 400
expect state popup choice
expect state popup_value "50 MB"
key enter
wait 300
expect text "50 MB"
shot 02-settings
key esc
wait 300
key home
key enter
wait 500
key enter
wait 800
key down
key down
key enter
wait 1000
expect state reader_idx 2
expect state images OOOOOONN
expect text "Images are off"
shot 03-images-off
check images-off
key ctrl-o
wait 400
tap "Save for offline"
wait 1000
expect state is_saved 1
expect text "Saved without images: they are off in Settings"
shot 04-saved-text-only
